              "desc": "An eighth-note triplet: a third of a beat.",
              "key": "eighth_triplet",
              "name": "1/8T"
            },
            {
              "desc": "A dotted sixteenth note: three eighths of a beat.",
              "key": "sixteenth_dotted",
